<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηκίω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾱκίω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gush, bubble
				forth</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλασσα . . κήκῐε πολλὴ
				ἂν στόμα τε ῥῖνάς τε</span> much brine <i>gushed</i>
			up through his mouth, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.455
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.542
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ βυθοῦ κηκῖον αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					784
				</span></i>
			: c.acc.cogn., <i>bubble with, send forth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήκιε πόντος ἀϋτμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.929
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>ooze</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμάδα κηκιομέναν ἑλκέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					697
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span>
			
				Ep.
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>
		S.ll.cc.]</div>
